WarmongeAlaisha: Look at you! You've finally become a Tyro Warrior! Looks like you're not a slouch after all!
WarmongeAlaisha: Choosing your class is one of the biggest milestones of becoming a Starspire Hunter! Now you can unlock Combat Abilities! HUZZAH!
WarmongeAlaisha: Combat Abilities are special moves that you can unlock and improve using AP! Each class has exactly 4 active abilities that will greatly contribute to your effectiveness as a Hunter.
WarmongeAlaisha: Combat Abilities are designed to work together and maximize your effectiveness in battle, so don't focus on just one! Even if you might want to.
WarmongeAlaisha: As a Tyro, you'll excel at melee damage, crowd control, and taking hits from enemies. You love getting up close and personal, so this class is perfect for you!